 certain circumstances, we may need to request additional information to verify the identity of the member about whom the request is being made and/or to verify that the member has provided the authorized agent permission to submit the request. We may deny a request in the event we are not able to verify the authorized agent's authority to act on your behalf.If you are an authorized agent seeking to make a request to opt out of sales, sharing, or targeted advertising on behalf of a consumer, please contact us at privacy@life360.com.Annual Request MetricsCalifornia law requires us to compile metrics for the previous calendar year regarding consumer requests and responses. Below are certain metrics for requests we receive from all individuals (including California residents) between January 1, 2025, and December 31, 2025.
