This Life360 Privacy Policy (“Privacy Policy”) was last modified on July 10, 2026.Life360 protects and connects your loved ones, pets, and important items to make your life easier and less stressful. We take your privacy as seriously as you do, and we are committed to protecting it. This Privacy Policy explains our practices regarding the collection, use, disclosure, transfer, storage, and protection of personal information that is collected through our products and services, as well as your choices regarding the same. As you review our Privacy Policy, keep in mind that it applies to Life360, Inc.’s ("Life360", "we", "our", or "us") websites (for Life360 and Jiobit, collectively, “Websites”), mobile apps , help center, and other associated services we provide (“Services”). It also applies to Life360 physical devices (e.g., Pet GPS, Tile trackers and partner products that have the Tile-finding technology embedded within them) as well as other products such as Labels (“Products”). Before accessing or using our Products and/or Services, please ensure that you have read this Privacy Policy and understand how we collect, store, use, and disclose your personal information as described herein. If you are using our Life360 mobile app through a membership offered to you as part of an employee benefit program offered by your employer ("Employee Benefit Program Members"), then the following sections of this Privacy Policy do not apply to your use of our Life360 mobile app: Section III. Advertising Activities; Section IV.E. Disclosure of Information to Business Partners for their Own Use; and Section V.B. Controlling Aggregate Insights.This Life360 Privacy Policy does not cover personal information that our Life360 Ads Featuring Nativo division (“Life360 Ads Featuring Nativo”) collects and uses when you visit the websites or mobile apps of publisher and advertiser clients of Life360 Ads Featuring Nativo – this information can be found in our Life360 Ads by Nativo Consumer Privacy Policy. The Life360 Privacy Policy also does not cover personal information that Life360 Ads Featuring Nativo collects and uses from visitors to the Life360 Ads Featuring Nativo website and from its advertising and publishing customers’ representatives - this information can be found in our Life360 Ads Featuring Nativo Website Privacy Policy. Table of ContentsI. INFORMATION WE COLLECTII. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATIONIII. ADVERTISING ACTIVITIESIV. INFORMATION WE DISCLOSEV. YOUR CHOICES ABOUT YOUR INFORMATIONVI. OUR POLICY TOWARDS CHILDRENVII. HOW WE PROTECT YOUR INFORMATIONVIII. ADDITIONAL STATE, COUNTRY AND REGION-SPECIFIC PRIVACY TERMS A. ADDITIONAL DISCLOSURES FOR RESIDENTS OF CERTAIN STATES B. ADDITIONAL DISCLOSURES FOR THOSE IN EUROPE C. ADDITIONAL DISCLOSURES FOR THOSE IN AUSTRALIAIX. LINKS TO OTHER WEB SITES AND SERVICESX. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICYXI. CONTACT US IF YOU HAVE QUESTIONS OR CONCERNSXII. PREVIOUS POLICYXIII. KOREAN PERSONAL DATA PROCESSING POLICY (Privacy Policy) ADDENDUMI. INFORMATION WE COLLECTThe information Life360 collects depends on what Life360 Products or Services you use and how you use them. A. Information You Give Us DirectlyWhen you create or modify a Life360, Tile, or Jiobit account, update your preferences, purchase and/or activate a Product, contact us (including by social media or via our Help Center), participate in an online survey, or otherwise interact with Life360’s Products and Services, we may collect a variety of information, including:
