**Ingredient & Allergen Information
Domino’s stores will endeavour to provide products that do not contain allergens if requested by you, but traces of allergens, including traces of gluten, may be unintentionally present in food due to cross-contact during store operations. We cannot guarantee that your order will not contain allergens or gluten. Subject to law, Domino’s will not be liable for any costs, fees, claims, damages, or charges whatsoever, including medical costs, if a customer has any adverse reaction to a product sold through a Domino’s store. Please note that alterations to our menu and ingredients sourced from various suppliers may affect the allergen content of our menu items. We recommend customers read our Allergen & Nutritional Information listed for each product on our website or contact the Domino’s vocal team < for further information.
